<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78224" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακόλλ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is glued on</i>, perh. <i>ornamental woodwork
				glued on</i> furniture, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.7.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>crimp</i> or <i>loop</i> of string glued to a cylinder, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Aut.</u>
				23.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>eye-salve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.643
			</span></i>, Severusap.<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.96
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
